WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.586
Day 9. Counting On.

2
00:00:02.036 --> 00:00:10.036
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.536 --> 00:00:15.957
Put six things in a cup and two next to it. Say: six are in the cup. Keep six in your head.

4
00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:19.316
Touch the other two: seven, eight. Eight in all.

5
00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:23.239
Tip the cup out and count them all to check. It is still eight.

6
00:00:23.839 --> 00:00:27.728
Counting on is faster than counting all. Start from the bigger number.

7
00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:33.298
On the page, the number in the cup is the start. Your child counts on with the pictures.

8
00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:39.694
The next page has three story sums. Read each story out loud. Real things are always allowed.
